[{"text":"FVE[p, mu] is the D-4-dimensional vector p with Lorentz index \\mu.","anchor":"fve"},{"text":"Overview, FCE, FCI, FV, FVD, Pair.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"FVE[p, \\[Mu]]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\hat{p}^{\\mu }\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FVE[p - q, \\[Mu]]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(\\hat{p}-\\hat{q}\\right)^{\\mu }\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FVE[p, \\[Mu]] // StandardForm (*FVE[p, \\[Mu]]*)","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCI[FVE[p, \\[Mu]]] // StandardForm (*Pair[LorentzIndex[\\[Mu], -4 + D], Momentum[p, -4 + D]]*)","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"There is no special function to expand momenta in FVE.","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex = ExpandScalarProduct[FVE[p - q, \\[Mu]]]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\hat{p}^{\\mu }-\\hat{q}^{\\mu }\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex // StandardForm (*Pair[LorentzIndex[\\[Mu], -4 + D], Momentum[p, -4 + D]] - Pair[LorentzIndex[\\[Mu], -4 + D], Momentum[q, -4 + D]]*)","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Contract[FVE[p, \\[Mu]] FV[q, \\[Mu]]]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[0\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"}]